    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Exusiai\"]   I didn't expect Reunion, the self-proclaimed savior of the Infected, to attack other Infected.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Exusiai",
        "content": "I didn't expect Reunion, the self-proclaimed savior of the Infected, to attack other Infected."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Exusiai\"]   Now that... is what I call bad publicity.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Exusiai",
        "content": "Now that... is what I call bad publicity."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\", name2=\"char_103_angel_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   This Reunion infiltration did not just occur spontaneously.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Texas",
        "content": "This Reunion infiltration did not just occur spontaneously."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   I'm sure there were many Infected here who chose to follow Reunion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Texas",
        "content": "I'm sure there were many Infected here who chose to follow Reunion."
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_102_texas_1\", name2=\"char_103_angel_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Exusiai\"]   Ugh... They'd rather trust Reunion over Rhodes Island--",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Exusiai",
        "content": "Ugh... They'd rather trust Reunion over Rhodes Island--"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_106_franka_1\", name2=\"char_103_angel_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   Rhodes Island does not give empty promises.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "Rhodes Island does not give empty promises."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   There are many Infected who are willing to accept whatever Reunion offers, even if it's nothing more than an illusion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "There are many Infected who are willing to accept whatever Reunion offers, even if it's nothing more than an illusion."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   There are few who can see through the illusion.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "There are few who can see through the illusion."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   And among those who can, most are willing to give up everything just for that vague glimmer of hope.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "And among those who can, most are willing to give up everything just for that vague glimmer of hope."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Franka\"]   Who would choose to believe our little bunny, who is too kind to deceive others?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Franka",
        "content": "Who would choose to believe our little bunny, who is too kind to deceive others?"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#4\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
